      "mergeID": "6693bfedbab0094e5dda1858",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The Constraint Conversion & Animation remap present in the builder window is awesome! Unfortunately but understandably, it does not cover all use cases as it only scans the animators within the playable layers. Many users use non-destructive setups like Modular Avatar and VRCFury so their constraint animations will **NOT** be remapped.\n\nI'd like to request an option in the SDK utility dropdown for converting constraint animation paths in selected animations to VRC Constraints animation paths.",
